#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-affiliate-account-admin-settings.php:66
msgctxt "description text for how to change the endpoint of my account page."
msgid "By default, an affiliate can see their dashboard under My Account > Affiliate. A default endpoint is already set under WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced tab > Account endpoints."
msgstr "Som standard kan en affiliate se sin instrumentpanel under Mitt konto > Affiliate. En standardändpunkt är redan inställd under WooCommerce > Inställningar > Fliken Avancerat > Kontoändpunkter."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-affiliate-account-admin-settings.php:71
msgctxt "Admin setting name for affiliate dashboard page"
msgid "Custom page for affiliate dashboard"
msgstr "Anpassad sida för affiliate-instrumentpanelen"

#. translators: Affiliate dashboard shortcode.
#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-affiliate-account-admin-settings.php:74
#, php-format
msgctxt "Admin setting description for setup custom affiliate dashboard page"
msgid "Allow affiliates to view their dashboard on any page using the %s shortcode. If no page or any non-published page is selected, the dashboard will be shown on the default My Account > Affiliate page."
msgstr "Låt affiliates visa sin instrumentpanel på valfri sida med hjälp av kortkoden %s. Om ingen sida eller någon icke-publicerad sida väljs kommer instrumentpanelen att visas på standardsidan Mitt konto > Affiliate."

